{"success": true, "data": {"url": "https://www.fybercom.net/", "title": "Fybercom | Idaho Falls, ID | Fiber Optic Construction", "description": "Fybercom is a broadband construction company based in Eastern Idaho that has been building fiber networks since 2003. We design, construct and maintain Fiber Optic Networks.", "markdown": "# Fybercom – The Future is Fiber\n\n[Skip to content](#content)\n\n## Construction\n\nFybercom began as a construction company in 2003, laying and splicing fiber optic cable in the Eastern Idaho region. Today, we have expanded our construction expertise to cover a wide geographic region across the Mountain West and the Pacific Northwest. In addition to fiber construction, we place conduit and copper, install cabinets, vaults, and closures, and complete lateral connections.\n\n## Engineering\n\nOur engineering team designs, oversees, and manages fiber network deployments. Our GIS team provides GIS data development and management services. Our team is skilled at developing and implementing unique solutions to complex construction challenges.\n\n## Technology\n\nFybercom leverages technology to deliver greater value to our customers. Technology is embedded in every part of our business. Our proprietary and third-party tools enable us to operate with speed and precision.\n\n## About\n\nFybercom is a broadband construction company based in Eastern Idaho that has been building fiber networks since 2003. We design, construct and maintain Fiber Optic Networks. We strive to provide quality, on-time builds. In this day and age, internet has become a necessity of life. We believe all people deserve access to the internet regardless of where they live.\n\n[Learn More](https://www.fybercom.net/about)\n\n## Services\n\n[Design & Engineering](https://www.fybercom.net/design-engineering/) [Construction](https://www.fybercom.net/construction/) [OSP Engineering & GIS](https://www.fybercom.net/osp-engineering-and-gis/) [Project & Program Management](https://www.fybercom.net/project-management/) [Quality Assurance & Quality Control](https://www.fybercom.net/quality-assurance-quality-control/) [As-Built & Record Drawings](https://www.fybercom.net/as-built-record-drawings/) [Permitting](https://www.fybercom.net/permitting/) [Make-Ready](https://www.fybercom.net/make-ready/) [Construction Management](https://www.fybercom.net/construction-management/) [Aerial & Underground Analysis](https://www.fybercom.net/aerial-underground-analysis/)\n\n## Our Team\n\n[](https://www.fybercom.net/our-team/)\n\n## Careers\n\n[View Openings](https://www.fybercom.net/careers)\n\n## Recent News\n\n[See All News](https://www.fybercom.net/blog/)"}]
