{"success": true, "data": {"url": "https://www.fybercom.net/osp-engineering-and-gis/", "title": "OSP Engineering & GIS - Fybercom", "description": "OSP Engineering & GIS Fybercom's OSP Engineering team provides design, engineering, and GIS services for fiber optic networks. Our services include design from start to finish, as-built and record drawings, project management, and QA/QC.", "markdown": "# OSP Engineering & GIS\n\nFybercom's OSP Engineering team provides design, engineering, and GIS services for fiber optic networks. Our services include design from start to finish, as-built and record drawings, project management, and QA/QC.\n\n## Engineering\n\nOur team is a full-service engineering firm that can take your project from concept through construction and as-builts. Our services include feasibility studies, preliminary design, detailed design, permitting, construction staking, oversight, as-builts and record drawings.\n\n## GIS\n\nFybercom's GIS team leverages a wide range of industry tools, including ESRI products, to provide robust GIS data management and development services. Our GIS team works with our OSP engineers to develop fiber optic network designs for every phase of a project.\n\n## Technology\n\nFybercom leverages technology to deliver greater value to our customers. Our engineers and designers use software tools designed for the fiber optic industry, including Katapult Pro and AutoCAD.\n\n## Our Team\n\n[](https://www.fybercom.net/our-team/)\n\n## Careers\n\n[View Openings](https://www.fybercom.net/careers)\n\n## Recent News\n\n[See All News](https://www.fybercom.net/blog/)"}]
</tool_response>

