{"success": true, "data": {"url": "https://www.fybercom.net/about", "title": "About - Fybercom", "description": "Fybercom is a broadband construction company based in Eastern Idaho that has been building fiber networks since 2003. We design, construct and maintain Fiber Optic Networks.", "markdown": "# About Fybercom\n\nFybercom is a broadband construction company based in Eastern Idaho that has been building fiber networks since 2003. We design, construct and maintain Fiber Optic Networks. We strive to provide quality, on-time builds. In this day and age, internet has become a necessity of life. We believe all people deserve access to the internet regardless of where they live.\n\n## Our Story\n\nFybercom began as a construction company in 2003, laying and splicing fiber optic cable in the Eastern Idaho region. Over the years, we have grown to become a full-service fiber optic company, offering design, engineering, construction, and maintenance services. Our team has grown to include experienced engineers, designers, project managers, and construction crews.\n\n## Our Mission\n\nOur mission